config BR2_PACKAGE_EM357_NCP_FIRMWARE
	bool "em357-ncp-firmware"
	help
	  EmberZNet 6.7.8 NCP image for the on-board EM357 Zigbee
	  radio (UART, software flow control). ohc-zigbee flashes it at
	  boot when the radio runs an older EmberZNet, the way Control4
	  reflashes it from its own images. Selected by the zigbee
	  feature.
